gas.employeeDeclarationText:
I declare and confirm by my signature below that:
    a) all of the above information is true;

    b) I am not insolvent and no enforcement, execution or insolvency proceedings are pending against me, and my income from my existing employment relationship has not been, is not and shall not be subject to wage deductions, including court-ordered enforcement, tax administrator, administrative authority or other public body, nor under a wage deduction agreement with a third party (if my income were or should be subject to wage deductions, I undertake to notify the employer and provide the relevant decision or agreement);

    c) I am not aware that my income from the employment relationship with the current employer has been or should be subject to wage deductions (if it were or should be in the future, I undertake to notify the employer and provide the relevant decision or agreement);

    I have not concealed any material circumstances and the information provided is complete and true as of the stated date. I acknowledge that if any of the above information changes during my employment, I must report it to the employer without delay, at the latest within 8 days.

gas.emailDeclarationText:
With regard to my electronic (e-mail) address stated above, I declare and confirm by my signature below that:
    a) it is my private e-mail address not available to the employer;

    b) it is my private e-mail address that I wish to use for communication with the employer and which I keep adequately secured and access regularly (usually daily);

    c) I provide this e-mail address to the employer voluntarily for purposes including delivery of documents under Section 21(1) of the Labour Code;

    d) I agree that other documents and information relating to my employment may be delivered electronically to this e-mail address (or my data box);

if my private e-mail address changes, I undertake to notify the employer in writing without undue delay.

icuk.emailDeclarationText:
With regard to my electronic (e-mail) address stated above, I declare and confirm by my signature below that:
    a) it is my private e-mail address that is not available to the employer;

    b) it is my private e-mail address that I wish to use for communication with the employer and which I keep adequately secured and access regularly (usually daily);

    c) I provide this e-mail address to the employer voluntarily for purposes including delivery of documents under Section 21(1) of the Labour Code, including the employment contract, agreement to perform work, agreement on work activity or their amendments, agreement on termination of employment, and agreement on termination of a legal relationship established by an agreement to perform work or agreement on work activity, where such documents are concluded via electronic communications networks/services;

    d) I agree that all other documents and information relating to my employment with the employer, to which special delivery conditions (in particular those under the Labour Code) do not apply, may be delivered via electronic communications networks/services to my e-mail address stated above (or via my data box); if my private e-mail address changes, I undertake to notify the employer in writing without undue delay.
